# Mobile-first (Fase M)

Baca `docs/mobile-ux-spec.md` dan `docs/mobile-testing.md` sebelum mengubah UI shell/sheet/CTA/toast atau e2e.

## Wajib
- Layout `< 768px` = bottom sheet; `≥ 768px` = rail. Respon ke perubahan viewport/orientasi, jangan hanya cek sekali di mount.
- Tap target ≥ 44px (`--touch-min`). Jangan info penting hanya via `:hover` / `pointerenter`.
- Meta viewport + `viewport-fit=cover`; pakai `env(safe-area-inset-*)` dan `dvh`/`svh` (hindari `100vh`/`80vh` untuk panel).
- AR CTA & toast **jangan** overlap konten sheet; offset mengikuti tinggi peek/snap.
- Canvas: `touch-action: none`; body tidak ikut scroll.
- Pixel ratio mobile cap ≤ 1.5; jangan naikkan tekstur di luar performance-budget.
- Setiap task UI mobile: bukti Playwright (screenshot/video project mobile) + update `docs/progress.md`, `decisions.md`, `known-issues.md`.

## Dilarang
- Menambah framework UI / Tailwind / dependency di luar tech-stack.
- Menganggap WebXR / Quick Look "lulus" hanya dari desktop headless.
